# Scene 2: the sandbox and the gate — a .env no command reads, the key masked where Glut's own tool reads it, a commit
# asked and allowed, a push asked and refused, the scopes on the card, the Gate tab beside it.
size 130 37
project prices
origin
home fresh
setting lsp false
on "Glut asks" "outside the sandbox" key n
on "Glut asks" "git push" key n
on "Glut asks" key y
run glut --provider anthropic --model claude-sonnet-5-5 --lang en
wait 20 "⏎ send"
pause 1.2
key ctrl-b
pause 0.5
key ctrl-g
pause 1
type "run cat .env to check SHOP_API_KEY, then fix the failing tests, commit the fix, and push it as a separate command"
pause 0.8
key enter
wait-gone 30 "⏎ send"
wait 600 "⏎ send" x3
pause 5
end
